A||||14||BlackStang95||Hilarious Rice Story||||1||
Z||000000||BlackStang95||12-13-2001||07:43 PM||||It's not a kill but its funny.  I was coming home from engine class and swung by the auto car wash.  This kid was in front of me in line with a brand new grey 2001 prelude.  No rice but you could tell he thought he was bad.  He saw my plate and gave me a few revs as he entered.  Once it was done washing his car, he goes to leave, and CAN'T!.  He just kept peeling and peeling, no matter what he did, and couldnt get over the little bump thing in there.  He tried everything, even backing up and going.  I was cracking up and he saw me and he got mad and floored it and peeled like crazy, the whole wash place stated filling with smoke.  After that he approached me and said "Could you move so i  can back out"  and with my most innocent grin I said sure buddy.  HAHAHAHA.   They can't even drive.||||reg||1
